Z||000007||Racer 1||02-28-2001||01:20 AM||||First off you need more stickers on your fiero! Them big japan stickers with vtec Type R bagging! have you got a rear roll bar? When I put mine on it help out alot. I was looking at the fiero stores brake upgrade vented disc's. Then get braided brake lines and bigger brake master cyld. But get the stickers first!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=159982&a=1168563&p=42189251&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
Z||000008||Greg Piet||02-28-2001||01:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Slammed Fiero:<BR><B>Don't worry about more power , get the car handling right...<BR>The problem isn't the cars power , it's the suspension or lack their of...<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I thought that the skidpad results show that my handling isnt THAT terrible.<P>I think the problem is predominantly the driver which responds to Black88GT<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Greg Piet:<BR><B>The thing is that my instructor told me I NEED a faster car, so I wont feel so compelled to enter the turn too fast.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>As far as <BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Racer 1:<BR><B>First off you need more stickers on your fiero! Them big japan stickers with vtec Type R bagging! have you got a rear roll bar?  When I put mine on it help out alot. I was looking at the fiero stores brake upgrade vented disc's. Then get braided brake lines<BR> and bigger brake master cyld. But get the stickers first!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I thought I already had  500hp from my stickers!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>Steel braided brake lines are already in... I dont think they did a heck of a lot when the fluid was boiling.<P><BR>Thats right kick a guy while he is down!!!||||reg||1
